        "TileImage": "$($repository 57cc00a7-38a9-4a6f-8c77-1e366ed0fb85).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings, 47.\r\rYour targets are Luca Billione and Basilio Romani. The two co-bosses of the Mafia-affiliated Cravatta Nera Gang. For years, the pair have been ruling Sapienza, but a recent falling out risks civil war between the two. The Mafia believes the two and their right-hand men should be extinguished.\r\rBillione and Castagnoli are discussing their options in a borrowed apartment, while Romani and his stooge have taken over City Hall to bury their rivals legally. \r\rGood luck, 47",
